# TDD

**Sources:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) Tests; [agent-workflow.mdc](agent-workflow.mdc); E2E claims → [e2e-verification.mdc](e2e-verification.mdc). Cite paths — do not paste bodies.

**Titles:** AGENTS + CodeRabbit (`it` = short lowercase verb phrase, *verb + object + context*, no trailing period — not generic `it("should …")` tutorials).

**Red → Green → Refactor:** Small slices; **test first** when logic is unit-testable.

**Vitest:** AAA; **`vi.fn()`** at boundaries only — not the unit under test; DI / fakes over deep **`vi.mock`**; **`beforeEach`** / **`afterEach`**; **`it.each`** for tables. Prefer pure logic, validators, server modules; RSC/actions → extract testable modules; avoid brittle render tests unless repo already patterns that.

**E2E:** **`npm run test:e2e`** “done” = **e2e-verification.mdc** (full run). Ratio targets optional unless CI says so.

**Coverage:** Behavior over metrics; thresholds only if [`vitest.config.mts`](../../vitest.config.mts) / CI already set them.

**Avoid:** Implementation-detail tests; tautologies; flakes ignored; testing privates when public API suffices.
